John S. Hark: Suspicious? Nah not really. Although I do hear Bob talking a lot in his sleep. [ID:john 1.2]
- Talking? About what?
	You: Talking? About what? [ID:you 1.13.1]
	John S. Hark: Nothing crazy. He mostly just mutters the name of his wife and kids from home. It's really sweet honestly. I think the more he misses them, the less he talks when he's awake. Feel bad for the guy. [ID:john 1.3.1]
- What do you know about Charles?
	You: What do you know about Charles? [ID:you 1.13.2]
	John S. Hark: Not much. But he's very articulate. Every night I see him count his keys and other belongings before he sleeps. That guy never loses anything.[ID:john 1.3.2]
